        "created_at": "2025-07-25T04:13:28.280347+00:00",
        "notes": "Round two will be very similar to round one, but I sell the items from round one and take [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) and [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a). The reason for this is the same as our item choices in round one \u2013 you want to increase your damage output to help generate money, and ability energy isn't very useful yet.\n\nFor a third item I take [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) if I have the money, and if I don't I will take a green survival item or [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) again.\n\nTip:  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) is super useful vs. Ashe dynamite, Ana sleep, JQ ult, or any other status effect. Don't sleep on this item if you're struggling agains these heroes, it is absolutely worth it those cases to take this instead of one of the other items I recommended.",
